# {{app_name}}

B2B SaaS analytics workspace — scaffolded from **{{blueprint_title}}**.

## Configuration

| Choice | Value |
|---|---|
| Downstream warehouse | `{{warehouse_target}}` |
| SemanticPolicy strictness | `{{semantic_layer_strictness}}` |
| Projector refresh cadence | `{{refresh_cadence_minutes}} min` |

## Layout

- `src/analytics/ingest.ts` — product-event ingest into Iceberg
- `src/analytics/semantic.ts` — plain-English query layer
- `db/migrations/001_analytics_init.sql` — `analytics.event_inbox` + `analytics.semantic_audit`

## How it composes

```
product events → sdk-analytics.ingest()
                 ↓ Iceberg lakehouse (per-tenant partitions)
                 ↓ sdk-lineage projector (every {{refresh_cadence_minutes}} min)
                 ↓ canonical metric views (sdk-projection)
                 ↓ sdk-semantic.ask(intent) ← business user
                 ↓ optional fan-out → {{warehouse_target}} (connector)
```

